  "description": "\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHaochen Tian, \nTianyu Li, \nHaochen Liu, \nJiazhi Yang, \nYihang Qiu,\nGuang Li,\nJunli Wang,\nYinfeng Gao,\nZhang Zhang,\nLiang Wang,\nHangjun Ye,\nTieniu Tan, \nLong Chen, \nHongyang Li\n\n\ud83d\udce7 Primary Contact: Haochen Tian (tianhaochen2023@ia.ac.cn)\n\ud83d\udcdc Materials: \ud83c\udf10 \ud835\udd4f | \ud83d\udcf0 Media| \ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Slides | \ud83c\udfac Talk (in Chinese)\n\ud83d\udd8a\ufe0f Joint effort by CASIA, OpenDriveLab at HKU, and Xiaomi EV.\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udd25 Highlights\n\t\n\n\n\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f A scalable simulation pipeline that synthesizes diverse and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenDriveLab/SimScale.",
